Explanation of design decisions that route steps in header page. 

Routes:
Get/artworks
    - renders the homepage with all artworks and details
    - response is  html
Get/artists
    - renders the homepage with all arttists and details
    - response is  html
Get/users
    - renders the homepage with all users and details
    - response is  html


Get/artwork/:id
    - renders display artwork on seperate page
    - response is  html
Get/artist/:id
    - renders display artist on seperate page
    - response is  html
Get/user/:id
    - renders display user on seperate page
    - response is  html

Get/addArtwork
    - renders display artwork on seperate page
    - response is  html

Post/
    - create new Artwork
    - create new Artist
    - create new user


